}
```

Then a fake: counts invocations, normally returns real elapsed (delegate to _stopwatchElapsed) but on a chosen invocation adds a spike. That's clean and deterministic:

```dart
int contendedElapsed(void Function() body, {required Set<int> spikedCalls, int spikeUs = 300}) { ... }
```

